  "description": "Undeclared and temporary parameters (R-SQL-3 metadata and parameters). Saved QImplicit uses the undeclared [Which K]: reads its Parameters (Name, Type), opens it unassigned through the QueryDef and through Database.OpenRecordset, then assigns 2 and opens. A temporary QueryDef with PARAMETERS pK Long is read and run with pK = 2; a direct OpenRecordset of a PARAMETERS string and a temporary QueryDef declaring pK twice are controls. Asks each result, Errors and rows.",
